      "query": "{\"content\": \"Distributed twice so far (first prior to the requested response, and now for the first time with the full briefing on October 9, 2026). I expect the petition to be denied, potentially after one further relist if a Justice is drafting a dissent from denial. \\n\\nThe Court will likely deny the petition without comment. There is no circuit split, and the lower court decision is an unpublished memorandum disposition that simply applied settled law regarding state vaccination requirements",
